        <li><strong>System design: scale and data graph.</strong> LinkedIn's infrastructure operates one of the world's largest professional data graphs — connections, feeds, search, recommendations. Prepare for questions about: building a scalable news feed, designing a connection graph system, search infrastructure at LinkedIn's scale, or a job recommendation engine.</li>
        <li><strong>Know LinkedIn's tech stack.</strong> LinkedIn is a major Kafka, Hadoop, and Samza contributor. Familiarity with their open-source projects (Pinot, Brooklin, Azkaban) signals genuine depth and interest — especially for senior roles.</li>
        <li><strong>Behavioral: ownership and initiative.</strong> LinkedIn promotes internally and looks for engineers who drive impact beyond their tickets. Prepare STAR stories about improving systems, advocating for technical standards, and cross-team collaboration.</li>
